- ICLR World Models workshop paper title prefixed with "Modular"; OpenReview links for paper + narrative worlds.
- Theme: Dark/light toggle (dark default, localStorage). Header toggle on desktop and mobile.
- Research Journey: one-line "research idea" per project; bioacoustics includes animal2vec GitHub link.
- Section order: Hero → News → Publications → Research Journey → Awards → Contact.

